  "steps": [
    "Cut two side panels at 24 in long and three shelf boards at 28 in long from the pine.",
    "Drill pocket holes in the shelf ends and screw the lower shelf to the sides 4 in off the floor.",
    "Screw the top shelf in place 12 in above the lower one.",
    "Add the short back panel behind each shelf so shoes cannot scuff the wall.",
    "Sand everything to 120 grit and brush on a coat of furniture oil."
